  "ai_article_sha256": "552e0852110d216d2c319b5855215fa3bde9638b0732a999bcae4b24cc44afb5",
  "mixed_article_sha256": "df34a8c24802d54e1a073955a163b021394ec1f70ddd2b66fb442409487f6091",
  "human_source_sentence_count": 77,
  "ai_source_sentence_count": 65,
  "alignment_unit_count": 66,
  "selected_alignment_unit_count": 23,
  "mixed_sentence_count": 72,
  "selected_ai_sentence_count": 24,
  "actual_ai_sentence_ratio": 0.333333,
  "selected_alignment_score_min": 0.269041,
  "selected_alignment_score_median": 0.458429,
  "selected_alignment_score_max": 0.774615,
  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Whatever is it that we are all looking for?",
      "output_sha256": "8b8a31c3504fa42dc2eaadb03a39e5da8b39d1dffd13abc0f7b73d5cc3ed424e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "8b8a31c3504fa42dc2eaadb03a39e5da8b39d1dffd13abc0f7b73d5cc3ed424e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I fancy that it is really quite close.",
      "output_sha256": "037e8f217ccbf3a732ae4552f0865054f07c886925e3dfe03aeb761a19f88af9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "037e8f217ccbf3a732ae4552f0865054f07c886925e3dfe03aeb761a19f88af9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "When I was a boy I had a fancy that Heaven or Fairyland or whatever I called it, was immediately behind my own back, and that this was why I could never manage to see it, however often I twisted and turned to take it by surprise.",
      "output_sha256": "8e03db75f79131938e1e47eba8f3645f899491970d7ec244285e8a0e7bd2ecda",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "8e03db75f79131938e1e47eba8f3645f899491970d7ec244285e8a0e7bd2ecda",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I had a notion of a man perpetually spinning round on one foot like a teetotum in the effort to find that world behind his back which continually fled from him.",
      "output_sha256": "3a246dfa2635687dcbece8fd76af917dff9ec4ca08505522fbf7ea0b26017ab2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "3a246dfa2635687dcbece8fd76af917dff9ec4ca08505522fbf7ea0b26017ab2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Perhaps this is the reason the world spins.",
      "output_sha256": "06bc95f9bb9d6b16f41908f9d1aaff906492945ce37f4b77948b8910fe024925",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": 0.616964,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "164e5e1af59a53240af94a469d17859d784c90ea8ef9f78646524cdcdee5de51"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_ai_sha256": "06bc95f9bb9d6b16f41908f9d1aaff906492945ce37f4b77948b8910fe024925",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "It is as if the world is forever attempting to glance over its shoulder in pursuit of the elusive realm that it cannot exist without.",
      "output_sha256": "ab3cd9785dfdc5aca35ff0495fce2eb58ef1af856719c07f159368e0989f2c69",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.429691,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "32c938c214d3118e512b24d169b23087a4319a1e8e7cf672f737ae73ce0174cc"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ab3cd9785dfdc5aca35ff0495fce2eb58ef1af856719c07f159368e0989f2c69",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "In any case, as I have said, I think that we must always conceive of that which is the goal of all our endeavours as something which is in some strange way near.",
      "output_sha256": "d8d984b8b24684adaa566bf40d4d7bf2fa963b92afaa6e9b7c594aa2aaa688e0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "d8d984b8b24684adaa566bf40d4d7bf2fa963b92afaa6e9b7c594aa2aaa688e0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "While science takes pride in discussing the vast distances of its celestial bodies and the daunting remoteness of the phenomena it examines, poetry and religion insist on the immediacy of their subjects, often highlighting their unnerving nearness.",
      "output_sha256": "3867500ef4e0c3be15491c440bb6c4300f4ee5e7c475a37480885b162eeaa60a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": 0.389934,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        8,
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ed90455e5e3a9c28c86eaf764cab6e6abc5a1307fc3cb144e732404b3157e516",
        "2615738adb9548169ef3ed1a8ace022c8eef5cc2e36e472171332282ae575bbb"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3867500ef4e0c3be15491c440bb6c4300f4ee5e7c475a37480885b162eeaa60a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The Kingdom of Heaven is always described as being \"At Hand,\" while Looking-glass Land is merely a reflection through the glass.",
      "output_sha256": "446862e090383470c017132272f1fd05d3564101e0144f993eef8d39a799e49e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.631773,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9eec9fac9f993f814a0bf887681f1dce9924ddf0545bfb674501f47c35cdfdec"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_ai_sha256": "446862e090383470c017132272f1fd05d3564101e0144f993eef8d39a799e49e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "So I for one should never be astonished if the next twist of a street led me to the heart of that maze in which all the mystics are lost.",
      "output_sha256": "c766b0c0e14cda0dd8a4d68c66be2864286811b33b3cce7e07d250f9dab1a9ab",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "c766b0c0e14cda0dd8a4d68c66be2864286811b33b3cce7e07d250f9dab1a9ab",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I should not be at all surprised if I turned one corner in Fleet Street and saw a yet queerer-looking lamp; I should not be surprised if I turned a third corner and found myself in Elfland.",
      "output_sha256": "2539437eb83e77c27c8b1d50718b20f7696cedd4f2397da2df9f462d38e6ba22",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "2539437eb83e77c27c8b1d50718b20f7696cedd4f2397da2df9f462d38e6ba22",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "However, what did catch me off guard recently was something far more unexpected.",
      "output_sha256": "e383c5e20e2988aa794306e7e5d5bf601f8c04390c237ada6b966eee0b3c5a74",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": 0.269041,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "50db22e529078c120dec4c682aa8ec398e9e65bc45223932877eeff66c2b9de2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e383c5e20e2988aa794306e7e5d5bf601f8c04390c237ada6b966eee0b3c5a74",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I ventured out of Fleet Street and unexpectedly found myself in England.",
      "output_sha256": "1a3177bcf19506a1c88d1dabfb4a7642ab29ec022d81c632e7a9aadf910264ca",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": 0.774615,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        14,
        15
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "19afbaac08031d1c11bda8db8762eef9b3556045f0ea47fce27e99e2d5009055",
        "f85d30e7d95a052f65167f1f1095186d1190c91502b4ab7aedab460a6eab8870"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1a3177bcf19506a1c88d1dabfb4a7642ab29ec022d81c632e7a9aadf910264ca",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The peculiar shock I felt likely merits some explanation.",
      "output_sha256": "9946e3865afd5ee7a066021be1629ed2a100bc01dc08c697c3e3fdb4ceb55c10",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": 0.428851,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f45eee7db48cdedd817cbac82cab38d267dec59ef2e26bc7687e89d63407f783"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9946e3865afd5ee7a066021be1629ed2a100bc01dc08c697c3e3fdb4ceb55c10",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "In the darkest or the most inadequate moments of England there is one thing that should always be remembered about the very nature of our country.",
      "output_sha256": "4418c8674a6d52c0da3691e86fdf5c5553495e8af8ba4d8ef2d1068dd197f4c3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "4418c8674a6d52c0da3691e86fdf5c5553495e8af8ba4d8ef2d1068dd197f4c3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It may be shortly stated by saying that England is not such a fool as it looks.",
      "output_sha256": "0fbc6ec9eb5a3937cbd5bfb6e17f09ad8db1887684ef65f437408226fbdbd6a8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "0fbc6ec9eb5a3937cbd5bfb6e17f09ad8db1887684ef65f437408226fbdbd6a8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The types of England, the externals of England, always misrepresent the country.",
      "output_sha256": "90fdcc46b81d0596b9ee09959c85fd989950bba176d53b99a6d09afa2c8a05c4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "90fdcc46b81d0596b9ee09959c85fd989950bba176d53b99a6d09afa2c8a05c4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "England operates as an oligarchy, deliberately presenting an elite that seems inferior to the general populace.",
      "output_sha256": "33f3e0a49172e969a10a838c2f3a0b75603c3a8fd0604090a69e06517e288f93",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": 0.450625,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8e6bb6749b268228b1d2953917cd65848d2851143cb61e5ef796a7f2257b8e81"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_ai_sha256": "33f3e0a49172e969a10a838c2f3a0b75603c3a8fd0604090a69e06517e288f93",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The speaking in the House of Commons, for instance, is not only worse than the speaking was, it is worse than the speaking is, in all or almost all other places in small debating clubs or casual dinners.",
      "output_sha256": "e32713f8ad109dd68a3f81e073c769e7dd1a6768aae9d61222398123113712a7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "e32713f8ad109dd68a3f81e073c769e7dd1a6768aae9d61222398123113712a7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Our countrymen probably prefer this solemn futility in the higher places of the national life.",
      "output_sha256": "9dc03354d250384ea124474d0ffe36b6df7e6c28299c309f642cf7f7878dcc81",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "9dc03354d250384ea124474d0ffe36b6df7e6c28299c309f642cf7f7878dcc81",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It may be a strange sight to see the blind leading the blind; but England provides a stranger.",
      "output_sha256": "635130402e58a8409d908145e62f894027b2d26c866a798c2cc5e5af3f135ad6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "635130402e58a8409d908145e62f894027b2d26c866a798c2cc5e5af3f135ad6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "England shows us the blind leading the people who can see.",
      "output_sha256": "0b288543cdd95257e21d590750c8756e31bdfb82baba784c05d70bfc8085e880",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "0b288543cdd95257e21d590750c8756e31bdfb82baba784c05d70bfc8085e880",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And this again is an under-statement of the case.",
      "output_sha256": "962bc2e01ffdc21b50765b2ba5aca53d63ec5b1334a1bb53e39e6c5e9cd4c2dc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "962bc2e01ffdc21b50765b2ba5aca53d63ec5b1334a1bb53e39e6c5e9cd4c2dc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "For the English political aristocrats not only speak worse than many other people; they speak worse than themselves.",
      "output_sha256": "117c3489bd85489321c8333131b0a224f3ab4a04929936156560e4fea4fe12a4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "117c3489bd85489321c8333131b0a224f3ab4a04929936156560e4fea4fe12a4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The ignorance of statesmen is like the ignorance of judges, an artificial and affected thing.",
      "output_sha256": "3bde06aea9578c521005f90be7c628a8183f5d3f93f82a60f15dab3a1050306d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "3bde06aea9578c521005f90be7c628a8183f5d3f93f82a60f15dab3a1050306d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "If you have the good fortune really to talk with a statesman, you will be constantly startled with his saying quite intelligent things.",
      "output_sha256": "811bf2a25cd8c856ec51accabc8f944720a354c0749e1b56aeb764e53d7928c1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "811bf2a25cd8c856ec51accabc8f944720a354c0749e1b56aeb764e53d7928c1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It makes one nervous at first.",
      "output_sha256": "0a8e32d174fb27cbdf2e7c72b23f736527662d6934cb248a42cf9070307bc523",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "0a8e32d174fb27cbdf2e7c72b23f736527662d6934cb248a42cf9070307bc523",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And I have never been sufficiently intimate with such a man to ask him why it was a rule of his life in Parliament to appear sillier than he was.",
      "output_sha256": "c49e0dc270cb8ea40cebcf9ad85b4d6e77041494df36ab39705427795f483e7c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "c49e0dc270cb8ea40cebcf9ad85b4d6e77041494df36ab39705427795f483e7c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is the same with the voters.",
      "output_sha256": "7cf68e1afe909e172756cd75ce645b8b0c492f4aeab4fb5c9d329baf8158c70f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "7cf68e1afe909e172756cd75ce645b8b0c492f4aeab4fb5c9d329baf8158c70f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The average man votes below himself; he votes with half a mind or with a hundredth part of one.",
      "output_sha256": "afeffa8beebae5ab5e302f2efa85195e98a32b6813a7f4cde161ca9e51c8353c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "afeffa8beebae5ab5e302f2efa85195e98a32b6813a7f4cde161ca9e51c8353c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "A man ought to vote with the whole of himself as he worships or gets married.",
      "output_sha256": "3d51c43c43ab0a28f8b4dd4cff74710b44410f75abe619721cf3853d5888b3a9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "3d51c43c43ab0a28f8b4dd4cff74710b44410f75abe619721cf3853d5888b3a9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "When casting a vote, one ought to engage their intellect and emotions, their spirit and physical instincts, their appreciation for beauty and their love for music.",
      "output_sha256": "f18b418ce95275a4fc9b99bc81008731b177a9dd8b8a591f67f177a313d0ea68",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": 0.345012,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d10d33e21b6c8337c9f13c05193154ebaad8c356d06f6da3e5e5b2c14ce93316"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f18b418ce95275a4fc9b99bc81008731b177a9dd8b8a591f67f177a313d0ea68",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "If he has ever seen a fine sunset, the crimson colour of it should creep into his vote.",
      "output_sha256": "a1c42246108df68084612ea696db77c9e3a79f16bf4e02adb09966439aae75fd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "a1c42246108df68084612ea696db77c9e3a79f16bf4e02adb09966439aae75fd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "If they have been moved by beautiful melodies, those songs should echo in their ears as they make that sacred mark.",
      "output_sha256": "a4e43ae5b1acd0c6d0d973ec189e07b3d88b0d42940556f06914d41ea04fa351",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": 0.348452,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "4ec6668cc3f439b5d73fe408256ff725a3db8b242ccb21741446dc99ca0216e9"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a4e43ae5b1acd0c6d0d973ec189e07b3d88b0d42940556f06914d41ea04fa351",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Yet, the challenge confronting English democracy at every election is that it often represents something less than its true potential.",
      "output_sha256": "551d0f343f34011be0013f7924c90cf293f9694db6f65f02f21adefb2041829c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": 0.525,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "583b1ff3a03def46fb114b28de38edc86eeaf29581e5ca904eee4b8d161b8e60"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_ai_sha256": "551d0f343f34011be0013f7924c90cf293f9694db6f65f02f21adefb2041829c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The issue is not merely that a minority of the electorate participates; rather, it is that a minority of those who vote truly engage with the process.",
      "output_sha256": "f9f3029f2bee5356c7904c4a076d9ebb5e9116ecea09aa83ef6d50980aa7cf1e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": 0.510826,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        38,
        39,
        40
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5cf5def3bdc9da79ce695d23b3f5cc51e753d2a672932ad96f05d265090310e1",
        "a93e2cd9df7d6df836e327dec9d62b5b186aeb036983ba1b9d81cb84181f7a3d",
        "f85d30e7d95a052f65167f1f1095186d1190c91502b4ab7aedab460a6eab8870"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f9f3029f2bee5356c7904c4a076d9ebb5e9116ecea09aa83ef6d50980aa7cf1e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "This is the tragedy of England; you cannot judge it by its foremost men.",
      "output_sha256": "e8da7da5dc77fb327ad0939e816f679a842ecc442fcb6a86eeea9bf8d8f8579e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "e8da7da5dc77fb327ad0939e816f679a842ecc442fcb6a86eeea9bf8d8f8579e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Its types do not typify.",
      "output_sha256": "718a1d3b9a0190c275eaa36ba21a8b136d894f397d661bd6152a88ea8df9d5e4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "718a1d3b9a0190c275eaa36ba21a8b136d894f397d661bd6152a88ea8df9d5e4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "On the occasion I reference, I discovered this to be particularly true of a once-vibrant middle class, which I assumed had nearly disappeared from existence.",
      "output_sha256": "e4225d796a3ebbd285bb65d6b9a3139ac99fa1e9226da7ddbc16179e2a7dd482",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": 0.445219,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "337a36c7e6308ede58acc9790b8421d1345044bcec433573b7cd3eda47085b21"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e4225d796a3ebbd285bb65d6b9a3139ac99fa1e9226da7ddbc16179e2a7dd482",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "It appeared to me that the primary representatives of this class had all drifted in different directions; they had either pursued the allure of the Smart Set or sought the simplicity of the Simple Life.",
      "output_sha256": "c1bce373be2cb58dbf3b776089b409b5870df3fe954b0094fce759be567605b5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": 0.541944,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8464db0b76f331d2e24b9eb6c4fdbc9205b39e6cb14d1fbf8346a1d3996721b1"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c1bce373be2cb58dbf3b776089b409b5870df3fe954b0094fce759be567605b5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Personally, I find it difficult to favor one over the other; those individuals may keep either—or, more likely, both—alternatively succumbing to the sickness of each.",
      "output_sha256": "093384514c55f20342cfa9e84b10066315dacd71b86ab26711f9f4abae7264d5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": 0.316856,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        45
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "40758346355744083fa299f6f6277f6c3007e2dc681d46f434206abb612f93fb"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_ai_sha256": "093384514c55f20342cfa9e84b10066315dacd71b86ab26711f9f4abae7264d5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But all the prominent men who plainly represent the middle class have adopted either the single eye-glass of Mr. Chamberlain or the single eye of Mr. Bernard Shaw.",
      "output_sha256": "71d6b10ce70413fe6bcb86bde64ad454dba3498506733e886c2665be7fe4890b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_human_sha256": "71d6b10ce70413fe6bcb86bde64ad454dba3498506733e886c2665be7fe4890b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "This old class I speak of lacks a true representative.",
      "output_sha256": "7ab9f5b81e9f9ca49f34d05e9d1a8e0f7be82c9c5bdb682e930d8bb0534be0b9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": 0.481974,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a0a1f9b5b8be3412a241c3b0636e61036ff4e7165e27be3a27c0ea9bcd4985f0"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7ab9f5b81e9f9ca49f34d05e9d1a8e0f7be82c9c5bdb682e930d8bb0534be0b9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Its food was plentiful; but it had no show.",
      "output_sha256": "bf6a2a5ccd5363d99fd98a841b716d3f4e31263c3b5ca24759cd1783ef77f5e2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "bf6a2a5ccd5363d99fd98a841b716d3f4e31263c3b5ca24759cd1783ef77f5e2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Its food was plain; but it had no fads.",
      "output_sha256": "626cd037b2e1541e29932742c275642a39e391b90ec22d1bd78fa21414a2d326",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "626cd037b2e1541e29932742c275642a39e391b90ec22d1bd78fa21414a2d326",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It was serious about politics; and when it spoke in public it committed the solecism of trying to speak well.",
      "output_sha256": "dd23efe6293982b7d4dff20564347ff36c13c8c4a851d51e7bb62ad11ddbcca3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "dd23efe6293982b7d4dff20564347ff36c13c8c4a851d51e7bb62ad11ddbcca3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I thought that this old earnest political England had practically disappeared.",
      "output_sha256": "824d70781909322130aa93d22cef27e78d89e5e7422cb298ea875602e6320d50",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_human_sha256": "824d70781909322130aa93d22cef27e78d89e5e7422cb298ea875602e6320d50",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And as I say, I took one turn out of Fleet Street and I found a room full of it.",
      "output_sha256": "d42abb7a315046cdb0d3592a98bf952dcdc173cba9cf4ecbc2e9a1721ef8af02",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_human_sha256": "d42abb7a315046cdb0d3592a98bf952dcdc173cba9cf4ecbc2e9a1721ef8af02",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": ".....",
      "output_sha256": "f85d30e7d95a052f65167f1f1095186d1190c91502b4ab7aedab460a6eab8870",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_human_sha256": "f85d30e7d95a052f65167f1f1095186d1190c91502b4ab7aedab460a6eab8870",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "At the top of the room was a chair in which Johnson had sat.",
      "output_sha256": "fb22617cc741f5bc1cf45b68aa82425e799cd54422704158cf7e62dc8e9038e4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_human_sha256": "fb22617cc741f5bc1cf45b68aa82425e799cd54422704158cf7e62dc8e9038e4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The club was a club in which Wilkes had spoken, in a time when even the ne’er-do-weel was virile.",
      "output_sha256": "bb3bcd5ec6cc8ffe721ea0d4e0597d777b72c1070e612f789ff7d2f1aa0ec507",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_human_sha256": "bb3bcd5ec6cc8ffe721ea0d4e0597d777b72c1070e612f789ff7d2f1aa0ec507",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "However, one could argue that these historical references might merely denote a bygone era.",
      "output_sha256": "8a765eb6d91bf431ae14254f8121c9201e9553b0c57407793fc3cc3fdab9191f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": 0.311607,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        56
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f03834e8e32a809cbc2bbe8eb9b2b1fadccd903d89cf43aac257c699659d98e6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8a765eb6d91bf431ae14254f8121c9201e9553b0c57407793fc3cc3fdab9191f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The extraordinary thing was that this hall had all the hubbub, the sincerity, the anger, the oratory of the eighteenth century.",
      "output_sha256": "3daf856194c7b8baf446777d745e6651d306097a6408d119a65956a90d06534b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_human_sha256": "3daf856194c7b8baf446777d745e6651d306097a6408d119a65956a90d06534b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The members of this club were of all shades of opinion, yet there was not one speech which gave me that jar of unreality which I often have in listening to the ablest men uttering my own opinion.",
      "output_sha256": "b5a803df6f0e5955776579eaa7af1687102e92e39e57d387ab269a0b2512b49b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_human_sha256": "b5a803df6f0e5955776579eaa7af1687102e92e39e57d387ab269a0b2512b49b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The Toryism of this club was like the Toryism of Johnson, a Toryism that could use humour and appealed to humanity.",
      "output_sha256": "30dbf515219914954066f2d5936ea032b43bfbbf39ada803dd14aae24540a998",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 59,
      "source_human_sha256": "30dbf515219914954066f2d5936ea032b43bfbbf39ada803dd14aae24540a998",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The democracy of this club was like the democracy of Wilkes, a democracy that can speak epigrams and fight duels; a democracy that can face things out and endure slander; the democracy of Wilkes, or, rather, the democracy of Fox.",
      "output_sha256": "04cbcaf59f6bea8ecb96e31deaacb1167e2e82559f297ea1cd33c72dac38f6fc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 60,
      "source_human_sha256": "04cbcaf59f6bea8ecb96e31deaacb1167e2e82559f297ea1cd33c72dac38f6fc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "One thing especially filled my soul with the soul of my fathers.",
      "output_sha256": "e18fb144c82fa7b4da6e8d898921091cecc38734089059a381cda8dd8366f912",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 61,
      "source_human_sha256": "e18fb144c82fa7b4da6e8d898921091cecc38734089059a381cda8dd8366f912",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Each man speaking, whether he spoke well or ill, spoke as well as he could from sheer fury against the other man.",
      "output_sha256": "3d5c4399df9296ffdc4704f8598ce4fbdeaf51c751fa6499f2e0510708cda40e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 62,
      "source_human_sha256": "3d5c4399df9296ffdc4704f8598ce4fbdeaf51c751fa6499f2e0510708cda40e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "This marks a significant decline in our modern political discourse.",
      "output_sha256": "d8cdb8602420ef1d1ad7575fbf68a02b36c48187acad4e585abff9e1659f354e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 55,
      "alignment_score": 0.466234,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        63
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "412ea2701efab995d7e7de35c24bdef188461eda91e18ad77c47411ff0618d8d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d8cdb8602420ef1d1ad7575fbf68a02b36c48187acad4e585abff9e1659f354e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        54,
        55
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 60,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Today, a speaker does not become more oratorical as their sincerity deepens.",
      "output_sha256": "fb92f4b8285cd2f41a096690267dea385f1b91c5ec82eff9ecb84a8984ae6ca0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 55,
      "alignment_score": 0.466234,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        63
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "412ea2701efab995d7e7de35c24bdef188461eda91e18ad77c47411ff0618d8d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_ai_sha256": "fb92f4b8285cd2f41a096690267dea385f1b91c5ec82eff9ecb84a8984ae6ca0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        54,
        55
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 61,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "An eighteenth-century speaker, when he got really and honestly furious, looked for big words with which to crush his adversary.",
      "output_sha256": "1b03f6702a5f474ad4c0bec4a5f50f3520379bc2358e4db5ad6bbeff61327bc7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 56,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 64,
      "source_human_sha256": "1b03f6702a5f474ad4c0bec4a5f50f3520379bc2358e4db5ad6bbeff61327bc7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 62,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The new speaker looks for small words to crush him with.",
      "output_sha256": "69b4e0a039b869dcce73e913f507d034130210348a30664e16b69dc0c12e944b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 57,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 65,
      "source_human_sha256": "69b4e0a039b869dcce73e913f507d034130210348a30664e16b69dc0c12e944b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 63,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "He looks for little facts and little sneers.",
      "output_sha256": "eacd8b5d31625c51c222d89dd0ce0d0b717dfb022b0157cbd67e04b2d6569465",
      "alignment_unit_index": 58,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 66,
      "source_human_sha256": "eacd8b5d31625c51c222d89dd0ce0d0b717dfb022b0157cbd67e04b2d6569465",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 64,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "In a modern speech the rhetoric is put into the merely formal part, the opening to which nobody listens.",
      "output_sha256": "272752411baedc4a3049df579090acb7eda13a9cbbb1f88e809dfaebe15d0af1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 59,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 67,
      "source_human_sha256": "272752411baedc4a3049df579090acb7eda13a9cbbb1f88e809dfaebe15d0af1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 65,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "When a politician—be it Mr. Chamberlain, a moderate figure, or a more radical socialist—becomes truly sincere, their discourse degenerates into something coarse, punctuated by phrases like, “Where do we come in?” or “It’s your money they want.”",
      "output_sha256": "a9cd910abd1a9b8828714e5f6e5266e887c1efe233d6ca9251347490406264f2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 60,
      "alignment_score": 0.384384,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        68,
        69
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
