      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 66,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The men in this eighteenth-century club were entirely different; they were quite eighteenth century.",
      "output_sha256": "3a1c3f5807169d4ca0a0be7f800b712cd8a61c2014623ff8198124715d4a7282",
      "alignment_unit_index": 61,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 70,
      "source_human_sha256": "3a1c3f5807169d4ca0a0be7f800b712cd8a61c2014623ff8198124715d4a7282",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 67,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Each one rose to his feet quivering with passion, and tried to destroy his opponent, not with sniggering, but actually with eloquence.",
      "output_sha256": "881f7b8ee69dc28ca7a799ae25dae8900d0723b2be46bc342358129ac071fd15",
      "alignment_unit_index": 61,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 71,
      "source_human_sha256": "881f7b8ee69dc28ca7a799ae25dae8900d0723b2be46bc342358129ac071fd15",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 68,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I found myself debating with them on the topic of Home Rule, and ultimately expressed my belief that the English aristocracy held disdain for the idea of an Irish Parliament because it would resemble their own club.",
      "output_sha256": "9d25d186ad7e29afa2807c3e743c7e6649e3d280333f9b0b9e7241572c7fc594",
      "alignment_unit_index": 62,
      "alignment_score": 0.520191,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        72
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "605580accc15bd19a0ab16b2ea82ae55612fd0b877b05723a101988f1718284d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 61,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9d25d186ad7e29afa2807c3e743c7e6649e3d280333f9b0b9e7241572c7fc594",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        61
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 69,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "As I exited the club and stepped back into Fleet Street under the dim glow of a streetlamp, I stumbled upon a crude poster about Wastrels, claiming that London was rising against something hardly anyone had heard of.",
      "output_sha256": "81b846b5682ddc4abaf6f3b1fe5eba35af53a5d6a55ed08ad29b43c80500adbd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 63,
      "alignment_score": 0.521366,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        73,
        74
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f85d30e7d95a052f65167f1f1095186d1190c91502b4ab7aedab460a6eab8870",
        "767be4644ec4b4322e8741c032faabd41202e71fea5ec0c34f0b4b5a40d3dec2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 62,
      "source_ai_sha256": "81b846b5682ddc4abaf6f3b1fe5eba35af53a5d6a55ed08ad29b43c80500adbd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        62
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 70,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Suddenly, it struck me, almost like a vivid tableau: the modern world resembles a vast and tempestuous ocean, teeming with monstrous, living entities.",
      "output_sha256": "b305ac4dac8a457b563633f8c0ac5cd960aa4e8e5679f3be9d7d7c3f4a232b3d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 64,
      "alignment_score": 0.406,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        75
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e565ab9fa374c3a03f057d62a34560172202f075c85532d6f10d4f5f4aa6368e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 63,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b305ac4dac8a457b563633f8c0ac5cd960aa4e8e5679f3be9d7d7c3f4a232b3d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        63
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 71,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And I saw that across the top of it is spread a thin, a very thin, sheet of ice, of wicked wealth and of lying journalism.",
      "output_sha256": "3e5a1e77bc44aee271c4d8cceac4ab40f35a55e896281483c0c6bd186280573c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 65,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 76,
      "source_human_sha256": "3e5a1e77bc44aee271c4d8cceac4ab40f35a55e896281483c0c6bd186280573c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 72,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Standing there in the shadows, I could almost hear that ice beginning to crack.",
      "output_sha256": "d3fcd3ac56f567bee595ce5cf52cb4c22af45d77eb750135904ebf7c8c4aa582",
      "alignment_unit_index": 66,
